{"id":"2008b2a5ddc83827","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-induction-rule.md","title":"Induction Rule","display":"df-induction-rule — Induction Rule","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-induction-rule","aliases":["72-df-induction-rule"],"display":"df-induction-rule — Induction Rule","depends_on":["[[72-df-sequence-sequent]]","[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-free-variable]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.II arithmetic sequent induction; explicit ordered-rule interface","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_2026_10_22":"补齐归纳规则带标签实例的上下文绑定与元组分组"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-induction-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-induction-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-induction-rule — Induction Rule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9f8d8c86ed32f12\" href=\"?note=c9f8d8c86ed32f12\" title=\"72-df-sequence-sequent\">72-df-sequence-sequent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdc2c33e939db2f8\" href=\"?note=fdc2c33e939db2f8\" title=\"72-df-free-variable\">72-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II arithmetic sequent induction; explicit ordered-rule interface"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"补齐归纳规则带标签实例的上下文绑定与元组分组"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c9f8d8c86ed32f12\" href=\"?note=c9f8d8c86ed32f12\" title=\"72-df-sequence-sequent\">72-df-sequence-sequent</a> 的五元签名，含常数0与一元函数S；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,a\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x,a\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[u/x]:=\\operatorname{SubFml}_{72}(A,u,x)\">\\(A[u/x]:=\\operatorname{SubFml}_{72}(A,u,x)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a>，只在下述自由代入条件成立时取值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\cup\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{ran}\\Gamma\\cup\\operatorname{ran}\\Delta}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t)\\cup\\{x\\}\">\\(a\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\cup\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{ran}\\Gamma\\cup\\operatorname{ran}\\Delta}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t)\\cup\\{x\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{IND}\">\\(\\mathsf{IND}\\)</span> 是固定新规则标签；IndTagged用同一输入元组及Γ,Δ的合法取值范围。规则实例编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\langle S_0,S_1\\rangle,S\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\langle S_0,S_1\\rangle,S\\rangle\\)</span>，不是对象逻辑蕴含。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IndInst}_\\Sigma(A,x,a,t,\\Gamma,\\Delta)\">\\(\\operatorname{IndInst}_\\Sigma(A,x,a,t,\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\)</span> 的定义域还要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall u\\in\\{0,a,S(a),t\\}\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(u,x,A)\">\\(\\forall u\\in\\{0,a,S(a),t\\}\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(u,x,A)\\)</span>；所有显示的部分代入只在此定义域内取值。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IndInst}_\\Sigma(A,x,a,t,\\Gamma,\\Delta):=\\left\\langle\\left\\langle(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta^\\frown\\langle A[0/x]\\rangle),\\ (\\Gamma^\\frown\\langle A[a/x]\\rangle\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta^\\frown\\langle A[S(a)/x]\\rangle)\\right\\rangle,\\ (\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta^\\frown\\langle A[t/x]\\rangle)\\right\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IndInst}_\\Sigma(A,x,a,t,\\Gamma,\\Delta):=\\left\\langle\\left\\langle(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta^\\frown\\langle A[0/x]\\rangle),\\ (\\Gamma^\\frown\\langle A[a/x]\\rangle\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta^\\frown\\langle A[S(a)/x]\\rangle)\\right\\rangle,\\ (\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta^\\frown\\langle A[t/x]\\rangle)\\right\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ind}_\\Sigma:=\\{\\operatorname{IndInst}_\\Sigma(A,x,a,t,\\Gamma,\\Delta):A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\land x,a\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\land a\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\cup\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{ran}\\Gamma\\cup\\operatorname{ran}\\Delta}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t)\\cup\\{x\\}\\land\\forall u\\in\\{0,a,S(a),t\\}\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(u,x,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ind}_\\Sigma:=\\{\\operatorname{IndInst}_\\Sigma(A,x,a,t,\\Gamma,\\Delta):A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\land x,a\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\land a\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\cup\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{ran}\\Gamma\\cup\\operatorname{ran}\\Delta}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t)\\cup\\{x\\}\\land\\forall u\\in\\{0,a,S(a),t\\}\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(u,x,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IndTagged}_\\Sigma:=\\{&amp;\\langle\\mathsf{IND},\\langle A,x,a,t\\rangle,\\vec S,S\\rangle:\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\land x,a\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\\n(\\langle\\vec S,S\\rangle=\\operatorname{IndInst}_\\Sigma(A,x,a,t,\\Gamma,\\Delta)\n\\land\\langle\\vec S,S\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Ind}_\\Sigma\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land a\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\cup\n\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{ran}\\Gamma\\cup\\operatorname{ran}\\Delta}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\n\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t)\\cup\\{x\\}\n\\land\\forall u\\in\\{0,a,S(a),t\\}\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(u,x,A))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IndTagged}_\\Sigma:=\\{&amp;\\langle\\mathsf{IND},\\langle A,x,a,t\\rangle,\\vec S,S\\rangle:\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\land x,a\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\\n(\\langle\\vec S,S\\rangle=\\operatorname{IndInst}_\\Sigma(A,x,a,t,\\Gamma,\\Delta)\n\\land\\langle\\vec S,S\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Ind}_\\Sigma\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land a\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\cup\n\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{ran}\\Gamma\\cup\\operatorname{ran}\\Delta}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\n\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t)\\cup\\{x\\}\n\\land\\forall u\\in\\{0,a,S(a),t\\}\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(u,x,A))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>前两项是真正两条前提，相同上下文按有序序列使用。新鲜性还排除A中原有的自由a；只检查Γ、Δ、t不足以保证参数有效。IndΣ可通过Hypothesis指定类型域上的带条件集合分离定义；集合分离中的类型、新鲜性与自由代入条件均已在显示式中展开。</p>\n<p>2026-10-22：为每个相继式增加元组分组，并在带标签集合中显式量化上下文及其新鲜性、代入条件，避免Γ、Δ悬空；归纳规则的数学内容未变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sequence-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"c9f8d8c86ed32f12","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequence-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"fdc2c33e939db2f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequence-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"c9f8d8c86ed32f12","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 是 [[72-df-sequence-sequent]] 的五元签名，含常数0与一元函数S；$\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma$。$A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)$，$t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$，$x,a\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"代入 $A[u/x]:=\\operatorname{SubFml}_{72}(A,u,x)$ 取 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]]，只在下述自由代入条件成立时取值。$a\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\cup\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{ran}\\Gamma\\cup\\operatorname{ran}\\Delta}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t)\\cup\\{x\\}$。$\\mathsf{IND}$ 是固定新规则标签；IndTagged用同一输入元组及Γ,Δ的合法取值范围。规则实例编码为 $\\langle\\langle S_0,S_1\\rangle,S\\rangle$，不是对象逻辑蕴含。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"x,a\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"A[u/x]:=\\operatorname{SubFml}_{72}(A,u,x)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\cup\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{ran}\\Gamma\\cup\\operatorname{ran}\\Delta}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t)\\cup\\{x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{IND}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\langle S_0,S_1\\rangle,S\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IndInst}_\\Sigma(A,x,a,t,\\Gamma,\\Delta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall u\\in\\{0,a,S(a),t\\}\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(u,x,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IndInst}_\\Sigma(A,x,a,t,\\Gamma,\\Delta):=\\left\\langle\\left\\langle(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta^\\frown\\langle A[0/x]\\rangle),\\ (\\Gamma^\\frown\\langle A[a/x]\\rangle\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta^\\frown\\langle A[S(a)/x]\\rangle)\\right\\rangle,\\ (\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta^\\frown\\langle A[t/x]\\rangle)\\right\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ind}_\\Sigma:=\\{\\operatorname{IndInst}_\\Sigma(A,x,a,t,\\Gamma,\\Delta):A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\land x,a\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\land a\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\cup\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{ran}\\Gamma\\cup\\operatorname{ran}\\Delta}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t)\\cup\\{x\\}\\land\\forall u\\in\\{0,a,S(a),t\\}\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(u,x,A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{IndTagged}_\\Sigma:=\\{&\\langle\\mathsf{IND},\\langle A,x,a,t\\rangle,\\vec S,S\\rangle:\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\land x,a\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\\n(\\langle\\vec S,S\\rangle=\\operatorname{IndInst}_\\Sigma(A,x,a,t,\\Gamma,\\Delta)\n\\land\\langle\\vec S,S\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Ind}_\\Sigma\\\\\n&\\hspace{18mm}\\land a\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\cup\n\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{ran}\\Gamma\\cup\\operatorname{ran}\\Delta}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\n\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t)\\cup\\{x\\}\n\\land\\forall u\\in\\{0,a,S(a),t\\}\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(u,x,A))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3675,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-205","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-induction-rule|df-induction-rule — Induction Rule]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-203","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-induction-rule — Induction Rule](72-df-induction-rule.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-219","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-induction-rule|df-induction-rule — Induction Rule]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-induction-rule]]"}],"outgoing":["c9f8d8c86ed32f12","3c073b947b255638","fdc2c33e939db2f8"]}